@startuml
title Provider 上下线后的地址通知与 Invoker 刷新

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  ActorBorderColor #1E40AF
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  ParticipantFontColor #172554
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

participant "Provider" as Provider
participant "ZookeeperRegistry" as Registry
participant "RegistryDirectory" as Directory
participant "Protocol" as Protocol
participant "Invoker Map" as InvokerMap

Provider -> Registry: 创建或删除 Provider 节点
Registry -> Registry: ChildListener#childChanged(...)
Registry -> Directory: notify(urls)
Directory -> Directory: 按 providers / routers /\nconfigurators 分类
Directory -> Directory: refreshInvoker(providerUrls)

alt empty:// 表示无可用 Provider
  Directory -> Directory: forbidden = true
  Directory -> InvokerMap: destroyAllInvokers()
else 存在 Provider 地址
  Directory -> Directory: toInvokers(urls)
  loop 每个合并后的 Provider URL
    alt 完整 URL 已存在
      Directory -> InvokerMap: 复用旧 Invoker
    else 新增或参数变化
      Directory -> Protocol: refer(serviceType, url)
      Protocol --> Directory: 新 Invoker
    end
  end
  Directory -> Directory: toMethodInvokers(newMap)
  Directory -> InvokerMap: 替换 methodInvokerMap\n和 urlInvokerMap
  Directory -> InvokerMap: destroyUnusedInvokers(old, new)
end

note over Directory,InvokerMap
下一次 list(invocation) 直接读取新快照，
业务代理本身不需要重建。
end note
@enduml
